---
layout: base.njk
title: Testimonials
permalink: /testimonials/
description: What podcast creators and listeners say about working with Yamini Ranjan.
---
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap page-head__inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">Testimonials</p>
    <h1>Kind words from creators and listeners.</h1>
    <div class="rating"><span aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</span> Five-star reviews from clients and listeners</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap testimonial-list">
    {%- for t in testimonials %}
    <figure class="quote{% if t.featured %} quote--large{% endif %}">
      <blockquote>“{{ t.quote }}”</blockquote>
      <figcaption><strong>{{ t.name }}</strong><span>{{ t.role }}</span></figcaption>
    </figure>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

